#: chapter/1e85da40-bbfc-4180-903e-6c569ed2da38/title
msgid "Administrative information"
msgstr "行政資訊"

#: question/73d686bd-7939-412e-8631-502ee6d9ea7b/title
msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "貢獻者"

#: question/73d686bd-7939-412e-8631-502ee6d9ea7b/text
msgid "Each person contributing to creating or executing the data management plan should be added as a contributor. A project probably should have a Contact Person, and a Data Curator."
msgstr "每位參與資料管理方案撰寫或執行的人員，皆應列為貢獻者 (contributor)。一個計畫通常會指定一名聯絡人 (Contact Person) 及一名資料策展人 (Data Curator)。"

#: question/6155ad47-3d1e-4488-9f2a-742de1e56580/title
#: question/9a7e42c3-eed2-46da-bf45-52acbf1eb50f/title
#: question/235b36a8-3df7-44b7-9d0f-2ced3e4281a3/title
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名稱"

#: question/3a2ffc13-6a0e-4976-bb34-14ab6d938348/title
msgid "E-mail address"
msgstr "電子郵件"

#: question/6295a55d-48d7-4f3c-961a-45b38eeea41f/title
msgid "ORCID Identifier"
msgstr "ORCID 識別碼"

#: question/6295a55d-48d7-4f3c-961a-45b38eeea41f/text
msgid "You will be presented with suggestions from [ORCID](https://orcid.org/), but you also have the option to manually enter the ORCID identifier."
msgstr "系統會顯示來自 [ORCID](https://orcid.org/) 的建議條目，但您也可以手動輸入 ORCID 識別碼。"

#: question/68530470-1f1c-4448-8593-63a288713a66/title
msgid "Affiliation"
msgstr "所屬機構"

#: question/68530470-1f1c-4448-8593-63a288713a66/text
msgid "You will be presented with suggestions from [ROR](https://ror.org/), but you also have the option to manually enter the affiliation that is not listed there."
msgstr "系統會顯示來自 [ROR](https://ror.org/) 的建議條目，但您也可以手動輸入未列出的所屬機構。"

#: question/829dcda6-db8a-40ac-819a-92b9b52490f5/title
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: question/829dcda6-db8a-40ac-819a-92b9b52490f5/text
msgid ""
"Roles in a project should be given as they are defined by [datacite](https://schema.datacite.org/meta/kernel-4.1/doc/DataCite-MetadataKernel_v4.1.pdf). \n"
"\n"
"You should specify at least one \"Contact Person\". If your project has a work package for data management, identify the leader of that work package as \"Data Curator\". At least one \"Creator of the DMP\" must be specified to ensure they are listed as a creator in the final DMP."
msgstr ""
"計畫中的角色應依照 [DataCite](https://schema.datacite.org/meta/kernel-4.1/doc/DataCite-MetadataKernel_v4.1.pdf) 的定義填寫。\n"
"\n"
"您應至少指定一位「聯絡人」。若您的計畫含有資料管理的分項工作，請將該分項工作的負責人標示為「資料策展人」。此外，至少必須指定一位「資料管理方案創作者」，以確保其在最終的資料管理方案中列為創作者。"

