#: question/c3dabaaf-c946-4a0d-889c-ede966f97667/title
msgid "Research Project(s)"
msgstr "研究計畫"

#: question/c3dabaaf-c946-4a0d-889c-ede966f97667/text
msgid "Add each of the research project(s) that you are (or will be) working on and for which the data and work are described in this DMP. Give each project a small identifying name for yourself."
msgstr "請分別列出您目前或未來將參與，且其資料與工作內容由本資料管理方案 (DMP) 描述的研究計畫。並為每個計畫設定一個您能辨識的簡短名稱。"

#: question/f0ef08fd-d733-465c-bc66-5de0b826c41b/title
msgid "Project name"
msgstr "計畫名稱"

#: question/5b765df9-299f-4855-9e99-aa844903f8f6/title
msgid "Project acronym"
msgstr "計畫簡稱"

#: question/56163eb0-0101-40b4-b1c1-580875196b5c/title
msgid "Project ID"
msgstr ""

#: question/56163eb0-0101-40b4-b1c1-580875196b5c/text
msgid "Project number is a unique number assigned to the project by the authority that is undertaking the project."
msgstr "計畫編號是由執行該計畫的單位賦予的唯一編號。"

#: question/22583d74-3c98-4e0a-b363-26d767c88212/title
msgid "Project abstract"
msgstr "計畫摘要"

#: question/a00ae929-d5cf-43c0-8e9e-cdb12ebde717/title
msgid "Link to a project proposal or another description of the methods used in the project"
msgstr "研究計畫書或其他計畫方法說明文件的連結"

#: question/de84b9b5-bcd0-4954-8370-72ea83916b8c/title
msgid "Starting date of the project"
msgstr "計畫開始日期"

#: question/cabc6f07-6015-454e-b97a-c34db4ec0c60/title
msgid "Ending date of the project"
msgstr "計畫截止日期"

#: question/36a87eac-402d-43fb-a0df-ac5963bdf87d/title
msgid "Funding"
msgstr "資金"

#: question/36a87eac-402d-43fb-a0df-ac5963bdf87d/text
msgid "Add all the funding that are part of this project."
msgstr "新增所有此計畫的資金來源。"

#: question/0b12fb8c-ee0f-40c0-9c53-b6826b786a0c/title
msgid "Funder"
msgstr "資助單位"

#: question/0b12fb8c-ee0f-40c0-9c53-b6826b786a0c/text
msgid "Specify the name of the funder that you ask for funding for your project. You will be presented with suggestions from [Crossref](https://www.crossref.org/), but you also have the option to manually specify a complete URL to the funder web site.\n"
msgstr "請指定您為此計畫申請經費的資助單位名稱。系統會提供來自 [Crossref](https://www.crossref.org/) 的建議，您也可以手動指定資助單位網站的完整網址。\n"

#: question/54ff3b18-652f-4235-8f9f-3c87e2d63169/title
msgid "Funding status"
msgstr "資助狀態"

