msgid "Grant number"
msgstr "補助編號"

#: question/353eeaca-45fa-4958-a33c-ec6de3075701/title
msgid "Costs"
msgstr "成本"

#: question/353eeaca-45fa-4958-a33c-ec6de3075701/text
msgid "List all costs connected with reusing, producing, storing, and distributing data. Also, list any extra costs, such as those associated with making the data FAIR or using specialized tools, if applicable."
msgstr "請列出與資料再次使用、產製、儲存與發布相關的所有費用。若適用，也請列出其他額外費用，例如使資料符合 FAIR 原則或使用專門工具所產生的費用。"

#: question/7098b454-bc5e-4f83-a95d-970aa42e1479/title
msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

#: question/b3d9b6ca-bd24-4fa3-a3bd-d15005b9ae8b/title
#: question/934f6592-a032-4ada-91b2-4448d740d157/title
