msgstr "貨幣"

#: question/ac1f8f04-17a2-49e9-b2ad-2a9f8e44efb3/text
msgid "You will be presented with suggestions from [ISO 4217](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html), but you also have the option to manually enter the currency."
msgstr "系統會提供來自 [ISO 4217](https://www.iso.org/iso-4217-currency-codes.html) 的建議，您也可以手動輸入幣別。"

#: question/e53fdad9-7799-4eb4-8b4d-fa9aa05f9d2d/title
