msgstr "請說明這筆費用將如何支付"

#: question/dbb99f35-bdd9-4637-890e-23ba5bc19d6a/title
msgid "Does the project require ethical approval? "
msgstr "該計畫是否需要倫理審查核准？ "

#: question/dbb99f35-bdd9-4637-890e-23ba5bc19d6a/text
msgid "If the project involves testing on animals or processing of personal data, an approval is likely needed. It is the responsibility of the Researcher to make sure that the project and associated data is in agreement with current legislation."
msgstr "如果計畫涉及動物試驗或個人資料處理，則很可能需要取得核准。研究人員有責任確保計畫及其相關資料符合現行法規。"

