#: chapter/82fd0cce-2b41-423f-92ad-636d0872045c/title
msgid "Re-using data"
msgstr "資料再利用"

#: chapter/82fd0cce-2b41-423f-92ad-636d0872045c/text
msgid ""
"Before you decide to embark on any new study, it is good practice to check all options to re-use existing available data, either collected or generated by yourself in an earlier project, or data from others (Barend Mons calls this \"Other PEople's Data And Services\" or OPEDAS). This can include reusable data that have been created for an earlier study, and also so-called \"reference data\" which is used by many projects.\n"
"\n"
"It is not because we can generate massive amounts of data that we always need to do so. Creating data with public money is bringing with it the responsibility to treat those data well and (if potentially useful) make them available for re-use by others. And the circle is only complete if such data is actually re-used."
msgstr ""
"在您決定展開任何新研究之前，良好的做法是先確認是否能再次使用現有資料，包括您在先前計畫中蒐集或產生的資料，以及他人的資料（Barend Mons 將其稱為「他人的資料與服務」，Other PEople’s Data and Services，簡稱 OPEDAS）。這些資料可能包括為先前研究建立、可再次使用的資料，以及許多計畫共同使用的「參考資料」。\n"
"\n"
"儘管能夠產生大量資料，也不表示我們都要這麼做。使用公帑產生資料，也意味著有責任妥善管理資料，並在資料可能有用時提供他人再次使用。唯有這些資料確實被再次使用，這個循環才算完整。"

#: question/726e4a24-6d81-440b-8a70-5d36fa65c3a9/title
msgid "Do you need guidance to find existing data?"
msgstr "您是否需要指引來查找既有資料？"

#: question/726e4a24-6d81-440b-8a70-5d36fa65c3a9/text
msgid "Research funding organisations more and more demand that you search for existing data sets that could have information that you need, before assuming you need to collect all data yourself. You are asked to list what you have been able to locate, and whether you have found it suitable to use in your research. Do you need pointers to find such existing data sets?"
msgstr "研究資助機構越來越常要求研究者，在認定必須自行蒐集所有資料之前，，先搜尋既有資料集有無您所需資訊的資料集。請列出您已找到的資料集，以及您認為這些資料集是否適合用於您的研究。您是否需要一些指引，以尋找這類既有資料集？"

#: answer/07f599c3-592c-479b-906c-36478ae792b9/advice
msgid ""
"There are data set search engines that can help you find diverse data on the web, such as:\n"
"* [Google Dataset Search](https://datasetsearch.research.google.com/)\n"
"* [OpenAIRE](https://explore.openaire.eu/search/find/research-outcomes?type=%22datasets%22)\n"
"* [FAIRsharing](https://fairsharing.org/search?fairsharingRegistry=Database)\n"
"\n"
"Also, many governments run their own \"government data portals\".\n"
msgstr ""
"有些資料集搜尋引擎可協助您在網路上尋找各類資料，例如：\n"
"* [Google Dataset Search](https://datasetsearch.research.google.com/)\n"
"* [OpenAIRE](https://explore.openaire.eu/search/find/research-outcomes?type=%22datasets%22)\n"
"* [FAIRsharing](https://fairsharing.org/search?fairsharingRegistry=Database)\n"
"\n"
"此外，許多政府也設有自己的「政府資料入口網站」。\n"

#: question/d4191666-21f3-4875-8426-d12a3aa1ffce/title
msgid "Will you need existing data from Natural Sciences?"
msgstr "您是否需要自然科學領域的既有資料？"

#: answer/ea62d905-0751-49ac-b74e-3600280f867d/advice
#: answer/a9c82092-1e95-4651-9bd3-608bbe91e5bc/advice
#: answer/5b97c0ce-e1af-4c7b-801c-73845a720ebd/advice
#: answer/bb3a8a14-7f1c-4cb3-bfb3-67346191195a/advice
#: answer/47c2c317-22a8-430d-8bec-617879a2c6f8/advice
msgid "_We are interested to receive your expertise on this topic. You can use the feedback button if you have resources that we could list here_"
msgstr "_我們希望能收到您在此主題上的專業意見。若您有可供我們列出的相關資源，歡迎使用回饋按鈕與我們分享_"

#: question/bc7538cd-2b28-446a-a448-2b316c4f36a2/title
msgid "Will you need existing data in particle physics?"
msgstr "您是否需要粒子物理領域的既有資料？"

#: answer/839c00ed-b7e6-46f0-a78e-9a1b6826a9d6/advice
msgid ""
"A great resource for particle physics data:\n"
"* [CERN Open Data Portal](https://opendata.cern.ch/)"
msgstr ""
"粒子物理資料的重要資源：\n"
"* [CERN 開放資料平台](https://opendata.cern.ch/)"

#: question/f2bcb8d2-6a73-43a4-a2d3-16f50e4577a5/title
