msgstr ""

#: answer/929cbf88-d270-493f-b821-2b62247ba159/advice
msgid "There are pointers to resources in life sciences at [ELIXIR Data resources](https://elixir-europe.org/services/tag/data-resources)."
msgstr ""

#: question/a781badf-f7ee-4588-9478-d31470f00c38/title
