msgid "Keeping a log of every step in the analysis workflow that has been run"
msgstr "記錄分析工作流程中每一個已執行的步驟"

#: question/106df534-f590-416b-8e4a-846edbdc4325/title
msgid "What standard(s) you will use to document provenance?"
msgstr ""

