msgid "What standard you will use to document provenance?"
msgstr ""

#: reference/7abea09a-913f-431e-9c4d-5bbcf2cf7c07/label
msgid "FAIRCookbook on Provenance information"
msgstr "FAIRCookbook 的溯源資訊說明"

#: reference/074d97c3-b83f-4bc8-b17c-bebaa22a0c4c/label
