msgid "Agreement"
msgstr "協議"

#: question/bd886f8e-7825-4f98-afb2-6079ae15c8ed/text
msgid "Add reference to established agreement."
msgstr "請新增已訂立協議的參考來源。"

#: question/8915bd25-db22-4ed6-bcc8-b1bbdc52989e/title
msgid "Do you need a Data Protection Impact Assessment?"
msgstr "您是否需要進行資料保護影響評估？"

#: question/8915bd25-db22-4ed6-bcc8-b1bbdc52989e/text
msgid "Where a type of processing is likely to result in a high risk to the rights and freedoms of natural persons, the controller shall, prior to the processing, carry out an assessment of the impact of the envisaged processing operations on the protection of personal data, a so called Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) - [Article 35](https://gdpr-info.eu/art-35-gdpr/). Note: Most types of research projects on health or genetic data require a DPIA, especially large-scale processing of sensitive data. "
msgstr "當某類處理可能對自然人的權利與自由造成高風險時，資料控制者應在處理前，評估預定處理作業對個人資料保護的影響，也就是資料保護影響評估 (DPIA)；請參見[第 35 條](https://gdpr-info.eu/art-35-gdpr/)。注意：大多數涉及健康或基因資料的研究計畫都需要 DPIA，尤其是大規模處理敏感資料時。 "

#: question/6cc96576-2535-46b3-8c9b-a12703ee96cc/title
msgid "Have Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA) been performed for the personal data?"
msgstr "是否已針對個人資料進行資料保護影響評估 (DPIA)？"

#: question/6cc96576-2535-46b3-8c9b-a12703ee96cc/text
msgid "The French Data Protection Authority (DPA) has made a [PIA tool](https://www.cnil.fr/en/open-source-pia-software-helps-carry-out-data-protection-impact-assesment) (endorsed by several other DPAs) available that can help in performing these impact assessments. Please also consult your Data Protection Officer of your organization."
msgstr "法國資料保護主管機關 (DPA) 提供了一項 [PIA 工具](https://www.cnil.fr/en/open-source-pia-software-helps-carry-out-data-protection-impact-assesment)，也獲其他多個 DPA 認可，可協助執行這類影響評估。也請諮詢您組織的資料保護官。"

#: answer/feb5bdea-9317-4fdd-8781-c26ce6e55fbf/advice
msgid "Please reconsider"
msgstr "請重新考量"

#: question/8cc50031-87d5-4b0e-8c3c-c7ded35fd263/title
msgid "List DPIAs done and for which parts of the data"
msgstr ""

#: question/fa72bb87-0403-4953-9536-4ac836843763/title
msgid "Dataset"
msgstr "資料集"

#: question/432c867e-8f29-47e6-9078-05bdf3d3fcb0/title
msgid "DPIA"
msgstr "DPIA"

#: question/3d09f311-07dd-49a0-8445-5eab8f9548fc/title
msgid "Why is a DPIA deemed necessary for this project?"
msgstr "為什麼此計畫被認為需要 DPIA？"

#: question/3d09f311-07dd-49a0-8445-5eab8f9548fc/text
msgid "Below listed are 9 criteria - provided by the EC - that might indicate that your project constitutes **high risk processing**.  Please check the indicators that apply your project. Consult the linked EC Guideline for explanations of indicators."
msgstr "以下列出由歐盟執委會提供的 9 項準則，這些準則可能顯示您的計畫構成**高風險處理**。請勾選適用於您計畫的指標。各項指標的詳細說明，請參閱連結中的 EC 指南。"

#: choice/7dd41e34-b8fb-4d4a-9dde-eb0954d9718f/label
msgid "Data concerning vulnerable data subjects including minors, employees, elderly, mentally incapacitated, patients receiving care"
msgstr ""

#: choice/1b4fef4e-73ba-4f59-8234-92879a6f09d9/label
msgid "Sensitive data or data of a highly personal nature: which includes racial or ethnic origin; political opinions; religious or philosophical beliefs; trade union membership; genetic data; data concerning health; biometric data; sexual orientation"
msgstr ""

