msgid "We are using a different licence"
msgstr ""

#: question/6b5d7d2e-c117-4e61-a597-5207bc7fc057/title
msgid "What other licence?"
msgstr ""

#: question/6b5d7d2e-c117-4e61-a597-5207bc7fc057/text
msgid "Preferably give a web pointer to the license."
msgstr "最好提供指向該授權條款的網頁連結。"

#: question/c83097bb-e057-4cde-848d-a2e57d6ee3c9/title
msgid "Is this a recognised reusable open source licence?"
msgstr ""

#: question/a1c37c05-57ff-499c-b58c-e90f511241fa/title
msgid "Did you choose the workflow engine you will be using?"
msgstr "您是否已選定要使用的工作流程引擎？"

#: answer/9e30350e-5d5b-4ecc-992c-3dd16f8638b3/label
msgid "Workflows will be run from a computer command line"
msgstr "我們會直接從命令列執行工作流程"

#: answer/e856c626-bf9e-4550-997c-c6d0f66205e4/label
msgid "Yes, we will be using what we always use"
msgstr "是，我們會使用一向使用的工具"

#: answer/e856c626-bf9e-4550-997c-c6d0f66205e4/advice
msgid "Make sure that you are not missing out on alternatives that would have better properties for the project"
msgstr "請確認您沒有忽略那些對本計畫而言可能具有更佳特性的替代方案"

#: answer/7626c84b-1b2a-4809-99d1-da4ad42f3c9b/label
msgid "Yes, we have selected one based on what features we need"
msgstr "是，我們已根據所需功能選定一個"

#: question/28b10fd8-28a6-49b8-822d-f3d47780ab20/title
msgid "Do you need the workflow engine to produce provenance information automatically?"
msgstr "您是否需要工作流程引擎來自動產製溯源資訊？"

