#: question/75af1eb3-1e0e-4be8-b0b6-cdb0883c791b/text
msgid "There is no concrete map of these features to suitable workflow engines at this moment, but filling in these questions can lead you to think about the most important features for the project"
msgstr "目前尚無具體的途徑對照表可參考，可用來將這些功能對應到合適的工作流程引擎；不過，填寫這些問題可協助您釐清本計畫最重要的功能需求"

#: question/15e6148f-f4e0-4bbc-93c5-6fdf4fe47608/title
msgid "Does the provenance need to be stored or converted to some standard format?"
msgstr "是否需要保存溯源資訊，或將之轉換為某種標準格式？"

#: question/ba0000c2-65e0-4af3-95c3-bdcc1d3de291/title
msgid "Can the work flow be annotated to make it understandable?"
msgstr "工作流程是否可以加上註解，使其易於理解？"

#: reference/b238d832-8418-4a92-9429-3c79f690bef4/description
msgid "Workflow reproducibility"
msgstr "工作流程可重現性"

#: question/ff6f53f1-1adc-4401-bbda-a159d283a8eb/title
msgid "Do you need the workflow engine to be run high-throughput?"
msgstr "您的工作流程引擎是否需要支援高通量執行？"

#: question/fdeb19c8-393c-4c4e-8c88-58a9c4d19e2b/title
msgid "Is ease of development of the workflow engine itself an issue for you?"
msgstr "工作流程引擎的開發容易度，對您來說是否是個問題？"

#: question/2122d8b6-ab79-4a20-9016-d2ab8d154a58/title
msgid "Can you reach out to the developers? Is there a contact?"
msgstr "您是否可以聯繫此工具的開發者？是否有聯絡窗口？"

#: question/c1cbd221-6881-42be-b6d6-8b842f3f05db/title
msgid "Does the workflow engine need to support a particular compute back end you will use?"
msgstr "工作流程引擎是否需要支援您會使用的特定的運算後端？"

#: question/20fa4bb1-ff56-4050-b20e-3544beb02c17/title
msgid "Does the workflow engine need standard tools for administrators?"
msgstr "工作流程引擎是否需要提供管理員使用的標準工具？"

#: question/f5b2b4d2-2031-47da-95ff-6d10792c841f/title
msgid "Is ease of development of the workflows an issue for you?"
msgstr "工作流程的開發容易度，對您來說是否是個問題？"

#: question/f3c858ab-a89f-4f08-9c17-ca45e38f9340/title
msgid "Does the workflow engine need a developer GUI?"
msgstr "工作流程引擎是否需要提供開發者 GUI？"

#: question/f1609178-599a-4da6-b93b-776e4f9b626c/title
msgid "Does it need to be easy to support new tools in a workflow?"
msgstr "是否需要能夠容易地在工作流程中支援新增工具？"

#: question/0567eb3f-3a55-4b8d-b61b-c530f8a52223/title
msgid "Does it need support for specific kinds of data processing or data integration pipelines?"
msgstr "是否需要支援特定類型的資料處理或資料整合流程？"

#: question/74d6de0c-8c7d-4001-8019-2a29391afed1/title
msgid "Does it need support for complex control structures like conditionals and/or loops?"
msgstr "是否需要支援複雜的控制結構，例如條件判斷或迴圈？"

#: question/d8833614-8fb5-4535-b448-8e657d17ad44/title
msgid "Does it need native support for specific data types?"
msgstr "是否需要對特定資料類型提供內建支援？"

#: question/5179b194-aef6-47c5-bfb0-a21a0ba950ef/title
msgid "Does it need  support for nested workflows?"
msgstr "是否需要支援巢狀工作流程？"

#: question/5a83b169-3e41-42a5-8a4e-5c8c78111d0e/title
msgid "Does it need  support collaborative editing of workflows?"
msgstr "是否需要支援協同編輯工作流程？"

#: question/add9596e-eaad-4720-9a11-f779fe1e6538/title
msgid "Is ease of use an issue for you?"
msgstr "易用性對您來說是否是個問題？"

#: question/6d31cd2e-ca00-4cf8-961e-f84d4dabdda4/title
msgid "Who are the people that will run the workflows?"
msgstr "會由哪些人執行工作流程？"

#: answer/272e49e3-688f-4a52-90fb-399be6ce7282/label
msgid "Computer savvy operators"
msgstr "熟悉電腦操作的人員"

#: answer/555dbdf9-0ddf-4294-8979-aea69eb1572d/label
msgid "Subject matter experts with a strong computer knowledge"
msgstr "具備深厚電腦知識的領域專家"

#: answer/7cfd3e4a-67e4-4988-804d-81c6589a7046/label
msgid "Subject matter experts with no affinity for computer solutions"
msgstr "不熟悉電腦化解決方案的領域專家"

#: question/6ed1691c-9298-48d7-aaf8-224bca512419/title
msgid "Does the running of work flows need to be controlled via a GUI?"
msgstr "工作流程的執行是否需要透過 GUI 控制？"

#: question/8330c11f-4a4f-4ed6-a088-58b50acfea62/title
msgid "Do work flows need to be run on remote computers?"
msgstr "您的工作流程是否需要在遠端電腦上執行？"

#: question/38b2a0d8-ce59-46cd-afa0-258c1b2f469f/title
msgid "Is durability of work flows important for you?"
msgstr "您是否需要工作流程日後仍能順利執行？"

#: question/0d13a230-a3eb-4f5e-b9c2-2f64a5d9c033/title
msgid "Do you need the same workflow to run next year? Durability against 'workflow decay'?"
msgstr "您是否需要同一套工作流程明年仍能順利執行？也就是說，是否需要防範工作流程因軟體版本、執行環境或相依工具改變而失效？"

#: question/655180dc-1cb9-41f6-8a36-7c6ecf02009a/title
msgid "Are all versions of all tools, including built-in tools, under total control of the project?"
msgstr "所有工具（包括內建工具）的所有版本是否都由計畫完全掌控？"

#: reference/d8f2ac46-06e7-405a-bcec-907cde71b596/description
msgid "Workflow durability"
msgstr "工作流程的長期可執行性"

#: question/92cab7ad-92ff-44ec-9678-8e5c95d66816/title
msgid "Do you need to be able to export/import workflows (e.g. in the Common Workflow Language, CWL)?"
msgstr "您是否需要能夠匯出或匯入工作流程，例如以通用工作流程語言 (CWL) 格式？"

#: question/75af1eb3-1e0e-4be8-b0b6-cdb0883c791b/title
msgid "Do you want your workflow engine to be professionally hosted by a specialised party?"
msgstr ""

#: question/bdce5cee-2930-4b30-b3d5-d503ab0b5d1a/title
